  "description": "BLACK+DECKER Crisp 'N Bake 6-Slice Digital Toaster Oven - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER Crisp 'N Bake 6-Slice Digital Toaster Oven - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER Crisp 'N Bake 6-Slice Digital Toaster Oven - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: Breakfast, lunch, and dinner just got easier with the BLACK+DECKER Crisp 'N Bake 6-Slice Digital Toaster Oven Sit down to a delicious evenly cooked meal 2x faster* thanks to 5 heating elements using calrod and quartz technology. And with the versatility and convenience of 8 digital cooking functions, cooking meals for you and the family has never been easier. Start your day with perfectly cooked toast or bagels for everyone. For lunch or dinner, you can set it to bake your favorite pizza, and for easy family meals of the week, air fry delicious meals without the need to add extra calories by adding extra oil. AirFry technology surrounds foods with high-intensity hot air to crunch your favorite fried foods with little to no oil so you can enjoy that fried flavor without the fat. Simply select a preset or use the digital controls to adjust and adjust shade, time and temperature for accurate cooking. And with dishwasher safe accessories, cleaning is a breeze!",
